  <!-- EN: preferred -->
  <PreferredXenotype.label>preferido</PreferredXenotype.label>
  <!-- EN: Believers consider this xenotype to hold a higher moral or spiritual status than others. They will be happy if their colony has only preferred xenotypes. However, having any preferred xenotypes means that all other xenotypes are considered disliked and believers will be unhappy living alongside them. -->
  <PreferredXenotype.description>Os crentes consideram que este xenótipo tem um estatuto moral ou espiritual superior ao dos outros. Ficarão felizes se a colónia tiver apenas xenótipos preferidos. No entanto, ter algum xenótipo preferido significa que todos os outros são considerados desagradáveis e os crentes ficarão infelizes a viver ao lado deles.</PreferredXenotype.description>
  <!-- EN: Become a non-preferred xenotype -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.0.description>Tornar-se um xenótipo não preferido</PreferredXenotype.comps.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Preferred xenotype -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>Xenótipo preferido</PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Disliked xenotype -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>Xenótipo desagradável</PreferredXenotype.comps.1.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>
  <!-- EN: All preferred xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>Todos os xenótipos preferidos</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Some disliked xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>Alguns xenótipos desagradáveis</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>
  <!-- EN: Many disliked xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.2>Muitos xenótipos desagradáveis</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.2>
  <!-- EN: Tons of disliked xenotypes -->
  <PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.3>Montes de xenótipos desagradáveis</PreferredXenotype.comps.2.thoughtStageDescriptions.3>
  
